; BIND export of kousenit.com — generated from live DNSimple state 2026-06-06
; For Cloudflare 'Add a domain' BIND import (Phase 1). Faithful mirror of current state.
; System records (NS, SOA) intentionally omitted — Cloudflare generates its own.
; After import set proxy state: apex+www = leave DNS-only for now (repoint in Phase 4);
;   certificate-service + mockhub = DNS-only (grey cloud) ALWAYS (Railway).
